{"title":"Career roadmap · Legal Executive","role":"Legal Executive","summary":"Career alignment:\nB.Com – Corporate Secretaryship provides a useful foundation for a Legal Executive working in corporate legal support, contracts, compliance, documentation and company-law processes. The degree gives exposure to commerce, business law and corporate administration, but a student should build additional competence in contract review, corporate law, legal research, compliance, documentation and legal technology.","facts":{},"about":[{"label":"Important distinction","text":"A B.Com graduate working as a Legal Executive is generally performing legal-support/compliance work. It does not by itself qualify someone to practise as an advocate or independently provide reserved legal services. Those pathways require the applicable legal qualification and professional requirements."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Legal Intern, Legal Executive, Legal Assistant, Compliance Executive"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Legal Executive, Contract Executive, Compliance Analyst"}],[{"text":"3–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Legal Executive, Contract Specialist, Legal & Compliance Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Manager, Contracts Manager"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Head of Legal Operations, Legal & Compliance Head, General Counsel track"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business + Legal Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business organisation"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Study the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Consumer protection"},{"text":"Labour/employment law"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Taxation fundamentals"},{"text":"Commercial transactions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to understand how businesses create obligations, enter contracts and comply with regulations."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2 — Corporate Law Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on the legal environment in which companies operate."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Companies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company formation"},{"text":"Memorandum and Articles"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Board meetings"},{"text":"General meetings"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Corporate records"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statutory filings"},{"text":"Registers and records"},{"text":"Board documentation"},{"text":"Meeting notices"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Regulatory correspondence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Law"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important areas for a Legal Executive."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Offer"},{"text":"Acceptance"},{"text":"Consideration"},{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Legality"},{"text":"Representations"},{"text":"Warranties"},{"text":"Indemnities"},{"text":"Limitation of liability"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"},{"text":"Governing law"},{"text":"Jurisdiction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commercial term","Legal obligation","Risk","Business impact"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Legal Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to work with common corporate documents."},{"type":"h","text":"Examples"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NDA"},{"text":"Service agreement"},{"text":"Vendor agreement"},{"text":"Employment agreement"},{"text":"Consultancy agreement"},{"text":"Purchase agreement"},{"text":"Lease agreement"},{"text":"Partnership/JV documentation"},{"text":"Terms and conditions"},{"text":"Privacy policy"},{"text":"Website terms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to copy templates, but to understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Parties","Scope","Obligations","Payment","Risk","Liability","Termination","Disputes"]},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a systematic contract-review approach."},{"type":"h","text":"Review checklist"},{"type":"p","text":"Check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parties"},{"text":"Definitions"},{"text":"Scope"},{"text":"Deliverables"},{"text":"Payment"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Representations"},{"text":"Warranties"},{"text":"Indemnity"},{"text":"Liability cap"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"},{"text":"Governing law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A vendor contract may contain:"},{"type":"p","text":"Unlimited liability for the customer."},{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Executive should identify this as a potential commercial/legal risk and escalate it to the appropriate lawyer or manager."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Legal Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong legal-research skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identify the legal issue"},{"text":"Find the relevant law"},{"text":"Locate applicable rules"},{"text":"Review notifications/circulars"},{"text":"Read judgments"},{"text":"Compare provisions"},{"text":"Prepare research notes"},{"text":"Cite sources"},{"text":"Prepare legal summaries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant law"},{"type":"h","text":"Applicable facts"},{"type":"h","text":"Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk/implication"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended action"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical compliance skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Filing tracking"},{"text":"Licence/registration tracking"},{"text":"Contract renewals"},{"text":"Regulatory deadlines"},{"text":"Board documentation"},{"text":"Corporate records"},{"text":"Compliance evidence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A useful project is a:"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Compliance Calendar"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"table","header":["Compliance","Due date","Owner","Status","Evidence"],"rows":[[{"text":"Filing A"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Pending"},{"text":"Document"}],[{"text":"Filing B"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Legal"},{"text":"Complete"},{"text":"Receipt"}],[{"text":"Contract renewal"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Legal"},{"text":"Review"},{"text":"Agreement"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Employment & Commercial Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Build awareness of areas frequently encountered by businesses."},{"type":"h","text":"Employment"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employment contracts"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Non-disclosure"},{"text":"Leave policies"},{"text":"Workplace policies"},{"text":"Employee obligations"},{"text":"Disciplinary processes"},{"text":"Termination documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vendor contracts"},{"text":"Customer contracts"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Service agreements"},{"text":"Distribution agreements"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Outsourcing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact legal requirements depend on the applicable jurisdiction and current legislation."},{"type":"h","text":"Intellectual Property"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Trademark"},{"text":"Patent fundamentals"},{"text":"Trade secrets"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"IP ownership"},{"text":"Assignment"},{"text":"Infringement concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Particularly important in technology companies:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Code","designs","content","trademarks","confidential information"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data & Privacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern Legal Executives increasingly need technology awareness."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personal data"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Data processing"},{"text":"Data retention"},{"text":"Data security"},{"text":"Privacy notices"},{"text":"Vendor data processing"},{"text":"Data breaches"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-focused careers, study the current Digital Personal Data Protection framework and applicable rules/guidance, verifying the latest legal position before relying on it professionally."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Legal Operations & Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how legal departments operate."},{"type":"h","text":"Legal operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Document management"},{"text":"Legal spend tracking"},{"text":"Compliance tracking"},{"text":"Matter management"},{"text":"Legal reporting"},{"text":"Risk registers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"PDF/document tools"},{"text":"Contract-management systems"},{"text":"Document-management systems"},{"text":"E-signature platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These skills can differentiate a Legal Executive from a purely documentation-focused candidate."},{"type":"h","text":"AI for Legal Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn responsible use of AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract summarisation"},{"text":"Clause extraction"},{"text":"Document comparison"},{"text":"Compliance tracking"},{"text":"Legal research assistance"},{"text":"Risk identification"},{"text":"Contract metadata extraction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But AI-generated legal output should be verified against authoritative legal sources and reviewed by appropriately qualified professionals."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a:"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Legal & Compliance Management System"},{"type":"h","text":"Modules"},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract database"},{"text":"Parties"},{"text":"Start/end dates"},{"text":"Renewal dates"},{"text":"Contract type"},{"text":"Responsible employee"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Requirement"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Due date"},{"text":"Owner"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Evidence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract risks"},{"text":"Compliance risks"},{"text":"Litigation/matter status"},{"text":"Risk severity"},{"text":"Responsible person"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Power BI to show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active contracts"},{"text":"Upcoming renewals"},{"text":"Pending compliance"},{"text":"High-risk matters"},{"text":"Contract categories"},{"text":"Department-wise compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced version"},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Document search"},{"text":"Automated reminders"},{"text":"AI-assisted clause extraction"},{"text":"Contract-risk tagging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If an honours/extended pathway is available, use the additional depth for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Legal"},{"type":"flow","items":["Company Law","Contracts","Governance","Compliance"]},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract Drafting","Review","Negotiation Support","CLM"]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulations","Compliance Calendar","Controls","Risk"]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Operations","Data","Automation","AI"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Corporate Legal"},{"text":"Company law, contracts, governance"}],[{"text":"Contract Management"},{"text":"Drafting support, review, CLM"}],[{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Regulations, controls, reporting"}],[{"text":"Legal Operations"},{"text":"Processes, data, technology"}],[{"text":"Employment Compliance"},{"text":"HR policies, contracts, labour compliance"}],[{"text":"IP Operations"},{"text":"Trademarks, copyright, licensing"}],[{"text":"Privacy Compliance"},{"text":"Data protection, privacy operations"}],[{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Research, case analysis, documentation"}],[{"text":"Risk & Compliance"},{"text":"Risk assessment, controls, monitoring"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com Corporate Secretaryship graduate, Corporate Legal + Contract Management + Compliance is a particularly logical combination."},{"type":"h","text":"Level 1 — Commerce"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Business","Economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 2 — Law"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contracts","Company Law","Commercial Law"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 3 — Documentation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Drafting Support","Contract Review","Records"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 4 — Compliance"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Calendar","Regulatory Tracking","Corporate Governance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 5 — Legal Operations"},{"type":"flow","items":["CLM","Document Management","Risk Registers"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 6 — Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Power BI","Basic SQL"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 7 — Legal Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Automation + AI-assisted Legal Operations"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from Year 2."},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Intern"},{"text":"Corporate Legal Intern"},{"text":"Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Contract Management Intern"},{"text":"Company Secretarial Intern"},{"text":"Legal Operations Intern"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Corporate Governance Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to learn"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Corporate documentation"},{"text":"Compliance tracking"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Board documentation"},{"text":"Company records"},{"text":"Regulatory filings"},{"text":"Contract databases"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Qualifications","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Company Secretary — CS"},{"type":"p","text":"For a student interested in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Secretarial compliance"},{"text":"Board processes"},{"text":"Corporate filings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"the Company Secretary (CS) pathway is highly relevant."},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com Corporate Secretaryship provides a useful academic foundation, but the professional CS qualification is a separate pathway with its own current eligibility, examinations and training requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Other useful qualifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on direction:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance certifications"},{"text":"Contract-management training"},{"text":"Data-privacy certifications"},{"text":"AML/KYC certifications"},{"text":"Legal operations training"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For technology-focused legal roles, certifications should complement actual legal/compliance experience rather than replace it."},{"type":"note","label":"Important Distinction","text":"Legal Executive vs Advocate"},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Com graduate can work in roles such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Executive"},{"text":"Contract Executive"},{"text":"Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Legal Operations Associate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But this should not be represented as equivalent to being a practising advocate."},{"type":"p","text":"If the student wants to become an advocate/legal practitioner, the appropriate law degree and professional requirements need to be followed."},{"type":"p","text":"A possible route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","LL.B","Bar-related professional requirements","Legal practice"]}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Com Corporate Secretaryship + relevant skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Executive"},{"text":"Legal Assistant"},{"text":"Corporate Legal Executive"},{"text":"Contract Executive"},{"text":"Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Legal Operations Associate"},{"text":"Corporate Governance Executive"},{"text":"Company Secretarial Executive"},{"text":"Contract Management Associate"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Legal Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"p","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Legal Executive"},{"text":"Contract Specialist"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Legal Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Manager"},{"text":"Contracts Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NDA"},{"text":"Indemnity"},{"text":"Liability"},{"text":"Warranty"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"IP ownership"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Company Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Board meetings"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Corporate records"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Research"},{"type":"p","text":"You may receive:"},{"type":"p","text":"“A company wants to terminate a vendor contract early. What would you check?”"},{"type":"p","text":"A good approach:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract","Termination clause","Notice period","Breach/default","Liability","Exit obligations","Dispute clause","Applicable law","Escalation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance tracker"},{"text":"Contract database"},{"text":"Renewal tracker"},{"text":"Risk register"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Data cleaning"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not mandatory for an entry-level Legal Executive."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful pathways include:"},{"type":"table","header":["PG / Qualification","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"LL.B"},{"text":"Legal practice and deeper legal careers"}],[{"text":"CS"},{"text":"Corporate governance and company secretarial work"}],[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"Commerce/accounting depth"}],[{"text":"MBA"},{"text":"Business/management"}],[{"text":"MBA Compliance/Risk"},{"text":"Compliance leadership"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Corporate Law"},{"text":"Corporate legal specialisation"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Contract Management"},{"text":"Contract-focused roles"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For someone specifically targeting corporate legal work, B.Com → LL.B or B.Com → CS, depending on the intended career, can be stronger long-term pathways than a generic master's."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's pathways:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LLM Corporate Law — usually requires an eligible law degree"},{"text":"MSc Compliance"},{"text":"MSc Corporate Governance"},{"text":"MSc Risk Management"},{"text":"MSc Legal Technology"},{"text":"MSc Business Law-related programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility varies significantly because many legal master's programmes require a prior law degree."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should verify professional-recognition and legal-practice requirements in the destination country."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Legal route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Legal Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal & Compliance Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Legal Operations / Legal & Compliance Head"},{"type":"h","text":"Company Secretarial route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com Corporate Secretaryship"},{"type":"h","text":"CS pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Company Secretarial Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Company Secretary / Governance Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Governance / Compliance Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal-practice route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com"},{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B","Professional legal requirements","Corporate Lawyer / Legal Associate","Senior Associate","Legal Counsel"]},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Management Route"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong alternative for students who enjoy business more than courtroom/legal practice."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Contract abstraction"},{"text":"Clause identification"},{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Contract negotiation support"},{"text":"Renewal management"},{"text":"Risk analysis"},{"text":"CLM platforms"},{"text":"Procurement processes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract Executive","Contract Specialist","Senior Contract Specialist","Contracts Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance & Risk Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Another strong pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Executive","Compliance Analyst","Risk & Compliance Specialist","Compliance Manager","Head of Compliance"]},{"type":"p","text":"Skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Compliance monitoring"},{"text":"Audit"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal operations will increasingly combine law","business","technology."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents","Manual Review","Filing","Tracking"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Contracts","AI Extraction","Automated Compliance","Risk Detection","Human Legal Review"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important future skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Legal AI"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Compliance automation"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Contract analytics"},{"text":"Legal data management"},{"text":"Cybersecurity awareness"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI may automate basic document review and summarisation, but legal judgement, negotiation, risk interpretation and accountability will remain important."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract Law","Company Law","Corporate Governance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract Review","Legal Research","Compliance Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Tracking","Risk Registers","Compliance Calendars"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Power Query","CLM/Document Management Systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI + Basic SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal AI","Privacy","RegTech","Contract Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional pathway"},{"type":"p","text":"CS / LL.B / relevant compliance qualification, depending on the desired career."},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commerce","Business Law","Company Law Fundamentals"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contracts","Corporate Governance","Legal Documentation","Excel"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Research","Compliance","Contract Review","Internship"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Operations","Risk","Power BI/CLM","AI Legal Tools","Final Project"]},{"type":"h","text":"Graduation target"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Corporate Secretaryship","Contract Law","Company Law","Legal Research","Compliance","Advanced Excel","legal internship","practical contract/compliance portfolio."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Com – Corporate Secretaryship → Legal Executive, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Company Law","Contract Management","Legal Research","Corporate Compliance","Excel/Legal Operations tools","Internship."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term progression, choose a clear direction early:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com → CS for corporate governance/company-secretarial careers,\nB.Com → LL.B for legal-practice/corporate-law careers, or\nB.Com → Legal Operations/Compliance for business-facing legal-support careers."}]}]}